            <ArticleTitle>Ogilvie's syndrome (colonic pseudo-obstruction) occurring in an 18-year-old Nigerian female.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>75-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Ogilvie's syndrome which is colonic obstruction without an identifiable distal mechanical cause is reported in an 18 year old female Nigerian. A high index of awareness is required to diagnose this condition.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
